		{
			dependencies: [
				"5C3628B6D376AB8F"
				"5C22BA84223D3925"
			]
			description: [
				"Before you continue, I'll go over the basics of the enchanting system in &6&lADJ&r."
				""
				"&nMost items have an enchantment cap of 3&r. It means that, well, an item &lcan only support 3 enchantments&r at the same time. &eGolden equipment&r can have 1 more enchantment because of its high enchantability"
				""
				"(on a side note, &eGold items&r have been &obuffed in durability&r)"
				""
				"&oEvery&r enchantment occupies &9one slot&r (with a minor exception which I'll explain later)."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The new &e&lEnchanting Table&r, unlike its vanilla counterpart, allows you to choose whatever enchantments you want. Neat!"
				""
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Now about the exception to the &c1 enchant&r = &91 slot rule&r: &l&4Curses&r add slots rather than occupy them! "
				""
				"If you think you can handle the &4Curses&r' negative effects, then you can put them on your items to increase their enchantment cap! "
				""
				"&oThough there is also a safer way to do it without any drawbacks which you'll discover very soon.&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			icon: "enchantinginfuser:enchanting_infuser"
			id: "22391120726D6ACC"
			min_required_tasks: 1
			subtitle: "Craft an Enchanting Table"
			tasks: [{
				id: "769864387A7FC8AF"
				item: "enchantinginfuser:enchanting_infuser"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Enchanter"
			x: 8.690476190476183d
			y: 6.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"610F4BE5F7B24952"
				"5C8C8742F4C523FA"
			]
			description: [
				"The primary use of &7&lAlloy Forges&r is to create &calloys&r from &cdifferent metals&r. Self-explanatory."
				""
				"Their secondary use is simple - being &omore efficient than Furnaces&r, yielding &omore metals from smelted materials&r!"
				""
				"&7&lAlloy Forges&r can be fueled by many different things, but &cLava&r is the most efficient."
				""
				"Looking to automate the process? &9Create&r mod got you covered!"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			icon: "alloy_forgery:cracked_stone_bricks_forge_controller"
